OL,3,AAlbertans have made 'clear choice' to
OL,4,Aremain part of Canada, says PM Mark
OL,5,ACarney
OL,6,
OL,7,FCanadian Prime Minister Mark Carney
OL,8,Fsays Albertans have made "a clear
OL,9,Fchoice" to reject a referendum on
OL,10,Findependence from Canada
OL,12,FEarly projections from national
OL,13,Fbroadcaster CBC after polls closed
OL,14,Findicates that the province has decided
OL,15,Fagainst holding a binding vote to
OL,16,Fseparate
OL,18,F"Alberta chose Canada", Carney says -
OL,19,Fyou can read his statement in full here
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
