OL,3,AAlbertans have made 'clear choice' to
OL,4,Aremain part of Canada, says PM Mark
OL,5,ACarney
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe province's premier says people have
OL,8,F"voted for a stronger Alberta", while
OL,9,Fseparatist leader Jeffrey Rath tells
OL,10,Fthe BBC the "movement isn't stopping
OL,11,Fand we're continuing to move forward"
OL,13,FAs results trickled in, supporters from
OL,14,Fboth sides of the campaign have been
OL,15,Freacting to the first figures
OL,17,FAs well as the referendum question,
OL,18,Fvoters were also asked on other matters
OL,19,Fincluding on immigration and voter ID -
OL,20,Fhere are the details
